Chapter 1. Project Study

\textbf{Introduction}

This chapter introduces the "Intelligent Store Monitoring and Analytics
System" project, a Final Year Project at ISG Tunis in partnership with
\textbf{Copy Basta Agency}. We'll begin by detailing \textbf{Copy
Basta's} structure and services. Then, we'll outline the project's goal:
addressing traditional store management issues with a solution powered
by \textbf{computer vision, AI, and data analytics}. Finally, we'll
explain our chosen methodologies: \textbf{Scrum} for agile management
and \textbf{CRISP-DM} for data-related tasks.

\textbf{1.1} \textbf{Host organization}

\textbf{1.1.1} \textbf{Copy Basta}

