\textbf{2.2} \textbf{Convolutional Neural Networks}

\textbf{2.2.1} \textbf{CNN Process}

A Convolutional Neural Network, or CNN, is a type of neural network that
processes images by applying a specialized filter known as a "Kernel"
across them {[}4{]}.

\includegraphics[width=4.68472in,height=2.63611in]{vertopal_8745fb96beba4c7f9cea35a5bfa22ab3/media/image13.png}
\end{quote}

\textbf{Figure 2.5:} CNN working on an image

\begin{quote}
Figure 2.5 represents a conceptual diagram of a convolutional network
working on an image.

These "kernels" are essentially grids of numerical values. Altering the
numbers within a kernel directly changes the outcome of the filtering
operation {[}4{]}.
\end{quote}

