\textbf{Figure 2.17:} YOLO predictions multiple classes

\begin{quote}
Figure 2.17 shows an example of YOLO predicting various classes within
sub-regions of an image {[}4{]}.

This approach is not only more efficient than R-CNN (since a single
inference generates classes for an entire image) but also yields better
performance. When R-CNN makes a predic-tion, it only has access to the
region proposed by selective search, which can make R-CNN less effective
at distinguishing irrelevant background objects {[}4{]}.

\includegraphics[width=5.35556in,height=2.83055in]{vertopal_8745fb96beba4c7f9cea35a5bfa22ab3/media/image26.png}
