\textbf{2.3.3} \textbf{YOLO Architecture}

The remarkable aspect of YOLO is its "one look" approach to object
detection. In a single pass through the model, both the class prediction
and bounding box prediction subtasks are performed concurrently.
Essentially, YOLO achieves this by outputting the S x S x C
