\begin{quote}
serving as a critical tool for manipulating perspective {[}5{]}.

The homography transformation maintains straight lines, which makes it
especially valu-able for BEV applications in autonomous driving. By
ensuring that roads, lane markings, and objects retain their correct
orientation and placement from an overhead viewpoint, the homog-raphy
matrix helps produce a dependable and geometrically accurate view
{[}5{]}.

Mathematically, the homography matrix is a 33 matrix, expressed as:
