\textbf{6.5} \textbf{Sprint Retrospective}

This sprint achieved significant milestones in the \textbf{development
of the Intelli-gent Store Monitoring and Analytics System's interactive
user interface} . We successfully delivered a \textbf{fully implemented
interactive dashboard} for store managers, offering comprehensive
analysis of customer activity. Key features included \textbf{customer
traffic heatmap visualization} , \textbf{average customer dwell time
analysis} , and a dedicated \textbf{shelf performance dashboard section}
, all built upon robust \textbf{data integration and processing logic} .
Through meticulous user story analysis, we ensured seamless interactions
for authentication, analysis initiation, and navigation across sections
like heatmap, shelf performance, people tracking, and demographics. A
crucial success was the implementation of \textbf{report downloading} ,
allowing managers to generate PDF reports directly from the dash-board.
From a system functionality perspective, we developed sophisticated data
analysis techniques, including spatial aggregation and Gaussian
filtering for heatmap analysis, detailed interaction detection and
metric calculation for shelf performance
\end{quote}

