\begin{quote}
Chapter 6. Sprint 3 - Deployment

(eg, engagement rate, traffic share, conversion rate, performance
score), and com-prehensive time spent calculations and distribution
analysis for people tracking.

However, this sprint also highlighted areas for future refinement. While
the dash-board is functional, further \textbf{UI/UX refinement} based on
user feedback could en-hance the visual presentation of complex metrics
and ensure optimal performance under heavy data loads. Additionally,
exploring more dynamic or sophisticated approaches for \textbf{heatmap
generation} (like Gaussian filter application) and \textbf{shelf
interaction definitions} could provide even more granular insights.

