managers to effectively use the system. We've shown how the dashboard
facilitates \textbf{authentication}, triggers \textbf{data analysis},
and provides access to critical insights from \textbf{heatmap analysis,
shelf performance, people tracking, and demographics}. The
\textbf{report downloading} feature will also provide accessible, By
